      "date": "2026-11-12 03:13:01.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 4:\n\n#### The following sessions will be run for Build 136013 (patch #4):\n\n#### Enforced:\n\n- review-ldiskfs-dne on el8.10-x86_64/el8.10-x86_64/ldiskfs/ldiskfs\n\n- review-ldiskfs-dne on el9.8-x86_64/el9.8-x86_64/ldiskfs/ldiskfs\n\n- review-ldiskfs-dne-arm on el8.10-x86_64/rocky9.8-aarch64/ldiskfs/ldiskfs\n\n- custom on el9.7-x86_64/el9.7-x86_64/ldiskfs/ldiskfs\n\n---\n\nMaloo Test Queue: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_queue?jobs=lustre-reviews&builds=136013&commit=Apply+Filter\n\nMaloo Results: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/related?jobs=lustre-reviews&builds=136013#redirect",
